<title>HONG KONG: Wing Fai posts HK$56.16 mln year loss.</title>
<headline>Wing Fai posts HK$56.16 mln year loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended July 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   13.7 loss  vs 18.8 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs 5.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  48.09 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    56.16 loss vs 69.02 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     518.48     vs 711.66</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wing Fai International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>Note - Wing Fai repairs and maintains civil engineering establishments and buildings in the public sector, including Hong Kong International Airport, and installs utilities including telephone facilities.</p>
<p>Exceptional loss represents provison for doubtful debts made in advances to subcontractors.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
